==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Don't get caught off guard by this stage, it's better to invest an Ancient Egg or one of your less useful anti-Dark CC units than to lose with pure fodder as Dark Otter and Shadow Boxer K can overwhelm mindless spam relatively easily.

